### Delivery Service API Testing
### Base URL: http://localhost:8088 (Internal) or http://localhost:8080/delivery-service (Gateway)

### 1. Register Courier
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/deliveries/couriers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "longitude": 30.5234,
  "latitude": 50.4501
}

###

### 2. Update Courier Location
PATCH http://localhost:8088/api/v1/deliveries/couriers/1/location?lon=30.5240&lat=50.4505

###

### 3. Update Delivery Status (Picked Up)
PATCH http://localhost:8088/api/v1/deliveries/1/status?status=PICKED_UP

###

### 4. Update Delivery Status (Delivered)
PATCH http://localhost:8088/api/v1/deliveries/1/status?status=DELIVERED

###
